  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Kupa \xDC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nB\xFCy\xFCk bir hedefin varm\u0131\u015F belli ki senin. Kafanda
    harikulade kutlamalar canland\u0131rm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Hayalini kurdu\u011Fun
    zafer tam anlam\u0131yla senin olabilseydi, eminim kendini \xE7ok \u015Fansl\u0131
    sayacakt\u0131n. Se\xE7ti\u011Fin karta ve a\xE7\u0131l\u0131\u015F \u015Fekline
    bak\u0131l\u0131rsa i\u015Fler pek de istedi\u011Fin gibi gitmemi\u015Fe benziyor
    {{isim}}. Hedefine ilerlerken yak\u0131nlar\u0131nda olan ve yard\u0131m ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    insanlar, amac\u0131na ula\u015Famad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda senin g\xF6z\xFCnde
    adeta \"d\xFC\u015Fman\" kesilmi\u015Fler. Her \u015Fey yolunda olmas\u0131na
    ra\u011Fmen neden sonuca ula\u015Famad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 \xE7ok sorgulam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Bir yerlerde bir hata olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011Fini, belki de birilerinin sana
    ihanet etti\u011Fini d\xFC\u015F\xFCnm\xFC\u015Fs\xFCn. Bu \u015F\xFCphelerin
    nedeniyle t\xFCm \xE7evreni yeniden g\xF6zden ge\xE7irmi\u015Fsin."
